OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy, humid and damp, with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle, and the
OL,7,Fodd heavier burst mixed in. Gradually
OL,8,Fturning drier and brighter from the
OL,9,Fnorthwest through the afternoon. Winds
OL,10,Fmainly light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FLargely cloudy but some
OL,13,Fclearer periods allowing the odd mist
OL,14,Fand fog patch to form, more especially
OL,15,Ftoward the east. Winds remaining
OL,16,Fmainly light. Mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
