OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCloud giving a few showers in
OL,6,Fplaces through the morning but
OL,7,Fgenerally drier and brighter into the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Feeling warm or very warm
OL,9,Fwith a gentle breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FChangeable with a little rain at
OL,13,Ftimes, interspersed with drier,
OL,14,Fbrighter periods. Temperatures above
OL,15,Fnormal at first, but trending nearer
OL,16,Fnormal later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
